Package: BridgeChange
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Change-Point Models with Bridge Prior for Time-Series and Panel Data
Version: 1.6
Date: 2026-04-01
Authors@R: c(
  person("Jong Hee", "Park", email = "jongheepark@snu.ac.kr", role = c("aut")),
  person("Soichiro", "Yamauchi", email = "syamauchi@g.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Bayesian implementation of Bridge regression with change-points
    for uncovering time-varying interaction effects in regression models.
    It implements change-point analysis using Bayesian Bridge prior where
    regression parameters (including all possible pairwise interactions)
    are allowed to change multiple times.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
